  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1564282369120636930",
  "created_at": "Mon Aug 29 16:02:35 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "This is not, of course, a story of some super powered dangerous hermit living in a fancy prison. There are terrible crimes, but he was the victim of.\n\nThe Man of the Hole was the last survivor or a tribe whose existence we were only made aware after they were all murdered.",
  "lang": "en",
