  "full_text": "In 1986, after multiple reports of genocide of uncontacted tribes, Santos, a representative of the Brazilian \"National Indian Foundation\" (FUNAI), went to the state of Rondonia to investigate and found a remains of a demolished village, where all the huts had 3m deep holes inside https://t.co/QdXSVyb4PQ",
