  "created_at": "Mon Aug 29 16:02:37 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "The farmers accused him of creating a fake tribe to prevent the regional development, threatened his life and he eventually was forced to quit. The story would have been forgotten but 10 years later Santos returned as the head of Uncontacted Tribes section, looking for survivors.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
